        "en": "ASIC halts offers in three mortgage schemes managed by Australian Secure Capital Fund",
        "zh": "ASIC 叫停 Australian Secure Capital Fund 管理的三只抵押贷款计划的发售"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "ASIC issued an interim stop order on the product disclosure statement of Australian Secure Capital Fund Limited, barring offers, issues, sales or transfers of units in the ASCF Premium Capital Fund, ASCF Select Income Fund and ASCF High Yield Fund. The regulator cited concerns the PDS may be defective, lacks clear disclosure of loan portfolio and diversification metrics, may contain a misleading statement, omits disposal costs and inadequately discloses an investor reserve account. At 30 June 2026 the Funds had $251.8 million in assets under management.",
        "zh": "ASIC 对 Australian Secure Capital Fund Limited 的产品披露声明（PDS）发布临时停止令，禁止其发售、发行、出售或转让 ASCF Premium Capital Fund、ASCF Select Income Fund 和 ASCF High Yield Fund 的基金单位。监管机构担心该 PDS 可能存在缺陷，未清晰披露基金贷款组合和分散化指标，可能包含误导性陈述，遗漏退出成本信息，且对用于覆盖减值和资本损失的投资者储备账户披露不足。截至 2026 年 6 月 30 日，这些基金管理资产为 2.518 亿澳元。"
      },
